%% class: layout-section

%% minutes: 1

## Make room for practice

Start with the time available, then choose what fits.

---

%% minutes: 4

## From a topic to a lesson

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Choose a topic] --> B[Explain one idea]
    B --> C[Practice together]
    C --> D[Review the result]
```

%% notes

Use the review to decide whether the next lesson needs another example.

---

%% minutes: 3

## Budget the session

```math
T = E + P + R
```

For a 30-minute session: 10 minutes of explanation, 15 of practice,
and 5 for review.

---

%% minutes: 3

## Adjust the balance

{.two-col}
:::
:::: before
### Before

```js
const session = {
  explain: 20,
  practice: 5,
  review: 5,
};
```
::::

:::: after
### After

```js
const session = {
  explain: 10,
  practice: 15,
  review: 5,
};
```
::::
:::

---

%% minutes: 2

## Check the total

{.layout-code}
:::
:::: code
```js
const times = Object.values(session);
const total = times.reduce(
  (sum, minutes) => sum + minutes,
  0,
);

console.log(total); // 30
```
::::

:::: explanation
Add every activity before adding another topic.

Leave time for the review even when the explanation runs long.
::::
:::
